From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:30:43 +0200
Subject: [ARCHEOLOGY] rockchip64: rock-2: enable USB and power the Wi-Fi
 module (6.18)

> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > Enable the USB 2.0 PHY and the host controllers. The ROCK 2F has no
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > Ethernet, so without USB it has no network.
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > Keep vcc_wifi on. It has no consumer, so the AIC8800 USB Wi-Fi module
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > stays unpowered. Linux 7.3 has both fixes upstream.
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
> X-Git-Archeology: - Revision 13b7e3feb7845654f2476ca90ecb494d8593fee6: https://github.com/armbian/build/commit/13b7e3feb7845654f2476ca90ecb494d8593fee6
> X-Git-Archeology:   Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:30:43 +0200
> X-Git-Archeology:   From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
> X-Git-Archeology:   Subject: rockchip64: rock-2: enable USB and power the Wi-Fi module (6.18)
> X-Git-Archeology:
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-rock-2.dtsi | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-rock-2.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-rock-2.dtsi
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-rock-2.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3528-rock-2.dtsi
@@ -94,6 +94,9 @@ vcc_wifi: regulator-3v3-vcc-wifi {
 		pinctrl-names = "default";
 		pinctrl-0 = <&usb_wifi_pwr>;
 		regulator-name = "vcc_wifi";
+		/* no consumer in the DT: keep the USB Wi-Fi module powered */
+		regulator-always-on;
+		regulator-boot-on;
 		regulator-min-microvolt = <3300000>;
 		regulator-max-microvolt = <3300000>;
 		vin-supply = <&vcc_3v3>;
